    "created_at": "2020-03-27T14:24:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-03-27T14:24:49Z",
    "body": "I guess I don't know why we'd want them to be distinct destinations. Why distinguish it as an SVG? `image` seems fine. Likewise, the CSP behavior seems like a bug in Firefox: `img-src` seems like it should control SVGs just like `<img>`.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
