    "created_at": "2020-03-27T14:48:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-03-27T14:48:38Z",
    "body": "Here are Chromium's [code search results for kSVGDocument](https://source.chromium.org/search?q=ResourceType::kSVGDocument&originalUrl=https:%2F%2Fcs.chromium.org%2F). \r\nFrom brief scanning I *think* it's mostly impacting a couple of error messages, but not much more than that...\r\n\r\nIt also seems Chromium is [explicitly translating](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/master:third_party/blink/renderer/platform/loader/fetch/resource_fetcher.cc;l=387) it to an \"image\" destination\r\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
