    "created_at": "2024-09-09T12:01:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-09-09T12:01:43Z",
    "body": "I am changing Firefox ([bug 1773976](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1773976)) to treat CSS `filter: url(\"foo.svg#bar\")` and SVG `<use>` as `\"image\"`, primarily because we were running into web-compatibility issues with CSP img-src not applying to these SVG loads.\r\n\r\nCould this be codified? I think there is currently no WPT for this behavior.",
