    "created_at": "2024-09-25T13:15:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-09-25T13:15:05Z",
    "body": "Using `image` for `<use>` seems very fraught.\r\n\r\nUltimately the `filter` property and `<use>` element specifications will need to set destination where they define their fetching pipeline (but I realize they probably don't).\r\n\r\nAn intermediate fix might be updating the table in Fetch and adding web-platform-tests, but it seems very concerning to classify `<use>` as \"`image`\". cc @whatwg/security ",
